{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o124a","title":"孙壹举众归魏拜车骑将军交州牧","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o124a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"孙壹举众归魏拜车骑将军交州牧","evidence":["shaodi-e-o124a-q"]},{"id":"shaodi-a-p034-judgment","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之认为孙壹因逼归命不应授礼过厚，并以孟达黄权孙秀孙楷比较。","evidence":["shaodi-q-p034-judgment"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-e894a45d65e2931de217","label":"正文","text":"綝遣朱异潜袭壹；异至武昌，壹知其攻己，率部曲千余口，过将胤妻奔魏","evidence":["zongshi-q-495c745c24e943347c58"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-82feaf1f5684007ab5d1","label":"正文","text":"魏以壹为车骑将军、仪同三司，封吴侯；以故主芳贵人邢氏妻之","evidence":["zongshi-q-c8c913b61216af99a383"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0112","role":"归降受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o124a-q"]},{"person":"houzhu-p0013","role":"遣袭者","evidence":["zongshi-q-495c745c24e943347c58"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0126","role":"受遣潜袭者","evidence":["zongshi-q-495c745c24e943347c58"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0049","role":"嫁壹者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c8c913b61216af99a383"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":257,"label":"六月乙巳","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y257","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o117","basis":"六月乙巳"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o124a-q","shaodi-q-o117","shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o124a-q","source_order":[4,530,"O124a"],"order":1189},{"id":"shaodi-e-o138b","title":"孙壹为婢所杀","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o138b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"孙壹为婢所杀","evidence":["shaodi-e-o138b-q"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-9e88fbf13cd2d218327b","label":"正文","text":"邢美色妒忌，下不堪命，遂共杀壹及邢氏","evidence":["zongshi-q-87b9127c6919627b45b5"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-61162003a672c5ed7c53","label":"正文","text":"壹入魏（黄初）三年死","evidence":["zongshi-q-8d889d5c3d2faae89e40"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0112","role":"被杀","evidence":["shaodi-e-o138b-q"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0049","role":"被杀者","evidence":["zongshi-q-87b9127c6919627b45b5"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":259,